# Density Compare
# Plutonium (Pu) — real density 19.85 g/cm³. equal masses: Plutonium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Plutonium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.4mm color: #00e080 at (-20mm, 3.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 158.3 g — the water cube is the reference
